<title>UK: Generale Des Eaux sets 1.0 bln Frf Oct 2003 bond.</title>
<headline>Generale Des Eaux sets 1.0 bln Frf Oct 2003 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>- The following bond was announced by lead manager Banque Nationale de Paris.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CIE GENERALE DES EAUX</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN FRF   COUPON     5.8 PCT   MATURITY    25.OCT.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.299   PAY DATE    04.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.70	REOFFER    99.949    SPREAD	+45 BP</p>
<p> LISTING    PARIS     S&amp;P     BBB+	DENOMS (K) 5</p>
<p>UNDERLYING OCTOBER 2003 OAT</p>
<p> NOTES	THERE IS A SHORT FIRST COUPON.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
